  m_Name: Read_ZoneProfile_Progression_Endgame
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Hecton8.World.WorldExpeditionLoopProfile
  profileId: loop.profile.progression.endgame
  profileLabel: Progression Endgame Read
  entryBeat: A strong silhouette or environmental shift warns that this water is
    serious.
  routineBeat: Routine value is sparse; the area tells the player this is not a lazy
    farm pocket.
  reliefBeat: Rare calm pockets matter because they create decision space before
    a deeper commitment.
  pressureBeat: Risk ramps through depth, exposure, and uncertainty rather than a
    forced gate.
  payoffBeat: A rare high-value lure exists deeper in for players willing to bring
    preparation and nerve.
  exitBeat: Getting out should reward memory, restraint, and choosing when enough
    is enough.
  playerFreedomRule: The player may sample the edge, turn back, or fully commit on
    their own terms.
  softProgressionPull: The area should tempt curiosity, need, and story hunger more
    than any scripted funnel.
  optionalDetourRule: Side observations should still teach something valuable even
    if the main lure stays out of reach.
  returnLogic: Retreat should preserve knowledge, landmarks, and unfinished intention
    for a later dive.
  masteryLogic: Mastery means assembling a personal deep-run plan from memory and
    judgment.
  playerPromise: Serious water with strong mystery, strong value, and honest consequences.
  routeMemoryRule: Memory should come from major shapes, rare shelter, and sharp
    pressure changes.
  failureMode: If this water becomes linear or obvious, it loses its awe and fear.
